<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Feb inflation to be published Friday.</title>
<headline>Portugal Feb inflation to be published Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute (INE) is expected to publish February consumer prices data on Friday, an official source of INE said. -- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
